<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Hex Radio plays internet radio stations from around the world, listed by Radio Browser, an open directory of stations. Open it from Start > Accessories > Hex Radio, the Accessories folder on the desktop, or by typing /radio."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_music_note}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Finding a Station")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The buttons under the list choose what it shows: TOP the most played stations, GENRE a menu of genres, FAV your favorites, and FIND a search by name, of at least two letters. Click a station to play it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_play}>{dgettext("help_ui", "The Player")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Play and Stop start and stop the station on the display; with nothing chosen, Play starts the first station of the list"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "The arrows on each side play the previous or the next station of the list"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "The star adds the station to your favorites, or takes it out; favorites are kept in this browser"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "The slider sets the volume, which is kept for next time; the speaker beside it mutes the sound without stopping the station"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_ui", "EQ and LIST show or hide the equalizer and the list of stations")}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_equalizer}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Spectrum and Equalizer")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Click the spectrum on the display to switch between the bars and the oscilloscope. The equalizer has ten sliders that raise or lower each band of the sound and a preamp, PRE, that raises or lowers all of it. ON switches the equalizer off and on without losing your settings, and FLAT puts every slider back in the middle."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Some stations do not share their sound with the page. They still play, but the SIM light comes on: the bars only dance along instead of following the music, and the equalizer cannot change them."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Good to Know")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Minimize the window and the music keeps playing; close it and it stops")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Space plays or stops and M mutes, while the window has the focus")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Hex Radio needs an account: visitors are asked to register")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-radio">{dgettext("help_ui", "/radio Command")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="keyboard-shortcuts">{dgettext("help_ui", "Keyboard Shortcuts")}</.help_link>
</p>
